#: ../../operations.rst:612
msgid ""
"Ordered dynamic rules, keyed by ``id``. The nullable ``ja4_pattern`` "
"holds a rule's JA4 criterion, at most 37 bytes."
msgstr ""
"क्रमबद्ध डायनामिक नियम, ``id`` से कुंजीबद्ध। nullable ``ja4_pattern`` "
"किसी नियम का JA4 मानदंड रखता है, अधिकतम 37 बाइट।"

#: ../../operations.rst:613
msgid "``policy_inspection``"
msgstr "``policy_inspection``"

#: ../../operations.rst:614
