"Each node's durable incident receipt (the next sequence after its last "
"committed batch), keyed by node."
msgstr ""
"हर नोड की स्थायी घटना रसीद (उसके अंतिम कमिट किए गए बैच के बाद का अगला "
"क्रमांक), नोड से कुंजीबद्ध।"

#: ../../operations.rst:619
msgid "``security_incidents``"
msgstr "``security_incidents``"

#: ../../operations.rst:620
msgid ""
"One bounded event record with its 64-component embedding (256 bytes), "
"keyed by ``node_id << 40 | sequence``. The nullable ``ja4`` holds the "
